---
// AboutMe component - Biography & Profile of Arkana Ravenno
---
<section id="about" class="space-y-12 scroll-mt-24">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="space-y-4 max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full glass-badge text-xs font-mono text-arctic-cobalt">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>01. BIOGRAPHY & PERSONAL JOURNEY</span>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Curiosity Meets Code. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-arctic-cobalt via-sky-frost to-pure-platinum">
        Membangun dari Logika ke Realita.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Mengenal lebih dekat siapa di balik nama Arkana Ravenno: mahasiswa rekayasa perangkat lunak, pembelajar tekun, dan pengembang yang antusias mengeksplorasi ekosistem teknologi modern.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid Profil Diri -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
    <!-- Card 1: Main Story & Background (Col-span 8) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-8 glass-panel about-bento-card aurora-beam p-7 sm:p-9 rounded-3xl border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-default select-none" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">
      <!-- Background Decorative Layers -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-card-glare"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-64 h-64 bg-arctic-cobalt/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-arctic-cobalt/25 transition-all duration-700"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-5 relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-arctic-cobalt font-semibold">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arctic-cobalt animate-pulse"></span>
            ABOUT ARKANA RAVENNO
          </div>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400">STUDENT & BUILDER</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white leading-snug group-hover:text-sky-100 transition-colors">
          "Bagi saya, software engineering adalah seni menyusun solusi yang elegan dari kerumitan logika."
        </h3>

        <div class="space-y-3.5 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Halo! Saya <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Arkana Ravenno</strong> (sering dikenal sebagai <span class="text-arctic-cobalt font-mono">Arkein</span>). Saat ini saya sedang menempuh pendidikan di bidang <span class="text-sky-frost font-medium">Software Engineering</span> dengan dedikasi mendalam untuk memahami bagaimana sistem modern dirancang, dioptimalkan, dan diwujudkan.
          </p>
          <p>
            Ketertarikan saya berawal dari rasa ingin tahu yang murni: bagaimana ribuan baris kode di balik layar bisa beroperasi harmonis membentuk aplikasi yang mempermudah kehidupan manusia. Dari rasa penasaran itu, saya mulai mengeksplorasi rekayasa web full-stack, logika backend, struktur data, hingga eksperimen integrasi model cerdas kontemporer.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Tags & Values (With Interactive Micro-Hover) -->
      <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 relative z-10">
        <span class="about-value-chip px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/80 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 cursor-pointer">
          🌱 Continuous Learner
        </span>
        <span class="about-value-chip px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/80 border border-arctic-cobalt/30 text-xs font-mono text-arctic-cobalt cursor-pointer">
          ⚡ Full-Stack Explorations
        </span>
        <span class="about-value-chip px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/80 border border-sky-frost/30 text-xs font-mono text-sky-frost cursor-pointer">
          🎯 Attention to Polish & Detail
        </span>
        <span class="about-value-chip px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/80 border border-emerald-400/30 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 cursor-pointer">
          💡 Practical Problem Solver
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Persona Snapshot & Vitals (Col-span 4) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 glass-panel about-bento-card p-7 rounded-3xl border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-default select-none" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="180">
      <!-- Background Decorative Layers -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-card-glare"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-frost/10 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-sky-frost/25 transition-all duration-700"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 relative z-10">
        <!-- Avatar Monogram Badge with Glow Ring -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-arctic-cobalt via-sky-frost to-pure-platinum p-0.5 shadow-xl shadow-arctic-cobalt/25 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:rotate-2 transition-transform duration-300">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-void-950 rounded-[14px] flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-extrabold text-xl text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-arctic-cobalt to-pure-platinum">
              ARK
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors">Arkana Ravenno</h4>
            <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">@ark.rvnn / Arkein</div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 mt-1">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
              Open to Collab & Learn
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Attribute List with Highlight Rows -->
        <div class="space-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
          <div class="about-attr-row flex justify-between items-center py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 transition-all">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Role</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">SE Student & Explorer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-attr-row flex justify-between items-center py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 transition-all">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Focus</span>
            <span class="text-arctic-cobalt font-semibold">Software Architecture</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-attr-row flex justify-between items-center py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 transition-all">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Primary Domain</span>
            <span class="text-sky-frost font-semibold">Modern Web & Systems</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-attr-row flex justify-between items-center py-1.5 border-b border-white/5 transition-all">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Location</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">Indonesia (GMT+7)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-attr-row flex justify-between items-center py-1.5 transition-all">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Mindset</span>
            <span class="text-pure-platinum font-semibold">Clean, Test, Iterate</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-5 mt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-center relative z-10">
        <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-900 border border-arctic-cobalt/40 text-arctic-cobalt hover:bg-arctic-cobalt hover:text-void-950 font-mono text-xs font-semibold transition-all group/btn">
          <span>Hubungi / Ajak Diskusi</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Deep Fundamentals (Col-span 4) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 glass-panel about-bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border-white/10 group cursor-default select-none relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="240">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-card-glare"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-36 h-36 bg-arctic-cobalt/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-arctic-cobalt/25 transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5 relative z-10">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-arctic-cobalt/15 border border-arctic-cobalt/30 flex items-center justify-center text-arctic-cobalt font-mono font-bold text-sm about-pillar-badge group-hover:bg-arctic-cobalt/25 group-hover:border-arctic-cobalt/60 transition-all duration-300">
          01
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-arctic-cobalt transition-colors duration-300">
          Fondasi yang Kokoh
        </h4>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Bagi saya, memahami konsep dasar komputasi—seperti struktur data, algoritma, siklus hidup software, dan arsitektur kode bersih—jauh lebih berharga daripada sekadar menghafal framework sesaat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Integrated Pillar Indicator Footer -->
      <div class="pt-4 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono relative z-10">
        <span class="text-arctic-cobalt font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-arctic-cobalt animate-pulse"></span>
          Core Principles
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">Architecture First</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: Craftsmanship & Design Polish (Col-span 4) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 glass-panel about-bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border-white/10 group cursor-default select-none relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-card-glare"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-36 h-36 bg-sky-frost/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-sky-frost/25 transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5 relative z-10">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-sky-frost/15 border border-sky-frost/30 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-frost font-mono font-bold text-sm about-pillar-badge group-hover:bg-sky-frost/25 group-hover:border-sky-frost/60 transition-all duration-300">
          02
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-sky-frost transition-colors duration-300">
          Estetika & Sensibilitas UI
        </h4>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Aplikasi yang hebat tidak hanya cepat dan stabil, tetapi juga terasa hidup saat digunakan. Saya menaruh perhatian khusus pada detail interaksi mikro, tipografi yang rapi, serta transisi visual yang natural.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Integrated Pillar Indicator Footer -->
      <div class="pt-4 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono relative z-10">
        <span class="text-sky-frost font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-frost animate-pulse"></span>
          Craft & Polish
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">Micro-Interactions</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 5: Curiosity & Exploration (Col-span 4) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 glass-panel about-bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border-white/10 group cursor-default select-none relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="360">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden rounded-3xl" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-card-glare"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-36 h-36 bg-pure-platinum/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-pure-platinum/20 transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3.5 relative z-10">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-pure-platinum font-mono font-bold text-sm about-pillar-badge group-hover:bg-white/20 group-hover:border-white/50 transition-all duration-300">
          03
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white group-hover:text-pure-platinum transition-colors duration-300">
          Eksplorasi Tanpa Henti
        </h4>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Dunia teknologi bergerak cepat. Di waktu luang, saya gemar mengeksplorasi pustaka open-source baru, membaca dokumentasi arsitektur, dan membangun eksperimen kode untuk menguji ide-ide segar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Integrated Pillar Indicator Footer -->
      <div class="pt-4 mt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono relative z-10">
        <span class="text-pure-platinum font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Continuous Loop
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">Build & Iterate</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
